identity was confirmable but the cited gameplay\nobservations and timestamps were not. Replace it with two written reviews whose\nfull article text was retrieved and read (RPGnet 2011-10-31; The Opinionated\nGamers 2011-11-12), spanning two distinct non-BGG organizational domains. Every\nreception and better-if claim now quotes retrieved prose.\n\nWithdraw the Boards of Madness image: its host asserts All Rights Reserved and\nno reuse basis was established. Component visuals are now reduced editorial\nexcerpts of the official Rules of Play PDF (pages 1 and 3); live table state\ncomes from a CC BY-SA 4.0 own-work Wikimedia Commons photograph, redistributed\nunder the same license with attribution. The deterministic transform for all\nthree panels and the contact sheet is recorded in the manifest.\n\nPacket remains ready_for_audit. No approval, promotion, or merge is performed.","tree":{"sha":"f56f801466f5dc54090d87c729c02b33222d3204","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/no-trbl-2-u/game-knowledge-base/git/trees/f56f801466f5dc54090d87c729c02b33222d3204"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/no-trbl-2-u/game-knowledge-base/git/commits/8eaa2513087f2877a4d19a1f03d541ce5a9391c1","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFJ0/clq\nrOKsrVVF2vzut4GjnmE67OA88J5Lk37oi9NIBv/ltqpmZLlWoa3lmtjk6hgpPQUKdeR9u8HS2vkW\nwgs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree f56f801466f5dc54090d87c729c02b33222d3204\nparent 67bef19eb0de5becac4e778c22a3d7e3627ced3f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785684824 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785684881 +0000\n\nkb: repair Elder Sign packet reception and visual rights basis\n\nWithdraw the Geek and Sundry TableTop YouTube source: independent audit reached\nonly HTTP 429/CAPTCHA, so video identity was confirmable bu